@startgantt
' SmartExam baseline schedule: 8 sprints x 4 weeks (project Weeks 1-32).
' One bar per activity A-I of tab:cpm (Chapter-3-3); sprint contents as tab:timeframe
' (Chapter-2-2) and the sprint list in Chapter-1-8. One time unit = one project week.
' The arrows are the dependencies of tab:cpm; C -> D does not move D (C has 2 weeks of float).
' Simplified labels: short task names; full module names are in Chapter 1.
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng gantt_chart.puml
skinparam dpi 150
printscale daily zoom 0.85
<style>
ganttDiagram {
  BackgroundColor white
  FontName Arial
  task {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 12
    FontColor black
    BackGroundColor #E6B0AA
    LineColor #B03A2E
  }
  milestone {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
    FontColor #B03A2E
    BackGroundColor #B03A2E
    LineColor #B03A2E
  }
  separator {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
    LineColor #9E9E9E
  }
  timeline {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 11
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #555555
  }
}
footer {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
  FontColor #333333
  HorizontalAlignment left
  Margin 4
}
</style>

-- Sprint 1 (Weeks 1-4) --
[A: Requirements and design] as [A] lasts 4 days

-- Sprint 2 (Weeks 5-8) --
[B: M1 Authentication] as [B] lasts 4 days
[B] starts at [A]'s end
[C: M7 User management] as [C] lasts 2 days
[C] starts at [A]'s end
[C] is colored in #E0E0E0/#6E6E6E

-- Sprint 3 (Weeks 9-12) --
[D: M8 Exam creation, M9 Eligibility] as [D] lasts 4 days
[D] starts at [B]'s end
[C] -> [D]

-- Sprint 4 (Weeks 13-16) --
[E: M2 Readiness, M3 Student dashboard, M4 Lockdown] as [E] lasts 4 days
[E] starts at [D]'s end
[FYP-I review] happens at [E]'s end

-- Sprint 5 (Weeks 17-20) --
[F: M5 Monitoring, M10 Proctoring] as [F] lasts 4 days
[F] starts at [E]'s end

-- Sprint 6 (Weeks 21-24) --
[G: M6 Submission, M11 AI evaluation] as [G] lasts 4 days
[G] starts at [F]'s end

-- Sprint 7 (Weeks 25-28) --
[H: M12 Audit and reports] as [H] lasts 4 days
[H] starts at [G]'s end

-- Sprint 8 (Weeks 29-32) --
[I: Integration and testing] as [I] lasts 4 days
[I] starts at [H]'s end
[Final submission] happens at [I]'s end

footer Red: critical path (32 weeks). Grey: task C has 2 weeks of float. Diamond: milestone.
@endgantt
